Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:06.800
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:04.290
Although you won against Ichi's team, there's still a long road ahead.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:06.080
Yeah, I'll do my best!

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:08.380
It's not like you need to do your best.

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:12.850
closed captions

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:11.460
With the Sweets Princes, won't it be okay anyway?

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.940
What's up with that? Hayame-san.

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:20.940
recipe 17

00:02:14.960 --> 00:02:20.940
Pâtissière Showdown<i>!</i>

00:02:15.770 --> 00:02:17.640
Pâtissière Showdown!

00:02:33.950 --> 00:02:36.510
Amano. We are going to dye the icing.

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:37.580
Yes.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:42.590
Huh?

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:47.700
What's this? It's too hard. The quality of the colouring will be bad.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:50.560
Ah, maybe I put in a little too much gelatin.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:54.570
"A little too much" you say!? You...!

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:55.810
Well, well, calm down a little.

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:01.780
It will become soft if you add egg albumin.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.520
Sorry...

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.500
Cookies are too simple to make.

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.610
Yeah...

00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:12.620
Listen, Amano.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:15.700
If you mess up next time, I won't forgive you.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:16.920
Do you get that!?

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:16.920
Seriously...

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:18.210
Yes, yes.

00:03:25.670 --> 00:03:27.700
It worked out really well!

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:31.300
So, put on the icing, Ichigo-chan.

00:03:31.300 --> 00:03:31.810
Yeah.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.380
Huh? I smell something burning.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:43.500
So, did you watch the anime yesterday?

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.360
I saw, I saw. It was really cute.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:47.240
Lots of moe moe, it was awesome!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.200
Once the box-set comes out, I'll definitely buy it.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.450
Hayami!

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.130
Why are you studying mathematics?

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.980
It doesn't concern you, does it!?

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.340
F-group, come over here.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:07.580
Well, you all did a <i>great job</i> on baking them.

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:09.070
Did you check the timer?

00:04:09.720 --> 00:04:11.310
Well...

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.060
Hayami, she...

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.610
I don't know anything.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:19.060
Geez, F-group.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:22.160
If you keep this up, you'll never step up.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:27.030
The F-group is really dumb.

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:30.610
It's the lowest ranked sweets making group, isn't it?

00:04:30.610 --> 00:04:35.750
If they work hard, they can rise to E and D-groups.

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:40.400
But... it seems they don't have that kind of motivation.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.130
She glared at me just now.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.840
Hey! Your hands have stopped moving.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:52.270
Sorry.

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:55.240
After school, wanna come to my room?

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:56.770
Then let's listen to Yui-chan's songs.

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.530
Oh, Yui-chan, huh?

00:04:58.530 --> 00:04:59.660
She's really moe moe.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:00.820
That sounds great!

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:02.230
Then let me do the dancing.

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:03.110
Me too.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:07.100
Well then, this question...

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:07.970
Hayami.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:08.610
Yes!

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.450
Hayami-san...

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:18.460
...is really good at her studies.

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:22.040
So, the last part... Andou-kun.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:22.780
Yes.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:23.710
Hayami-san.

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:24.430
Yes.

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:25.710
Amano-san.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:40.720
She got 95 points for her french test!

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:41.950
Amano-san.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.030
Yes!?

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:51.830
Then, everyone please do your corrections for the ones you get wrong before the lesson ends.

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.750
Correct everything...

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.250
Mapo tofu.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:02.790
Today's my favourite Mapo tofu~

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:07.170
You really like it don't you? Mapo tofu.

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:12.140
The vegetables absorb the smooth gravy individually.

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.840
It feels like a vegetable garden in my mouth.

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.480
Hayami-san.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.030
She's alone again.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:32.260
Even though he said do your corrections for the ones I got wrong...

00:06:32.260 --> 00:06:34.370
That's practically everything!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:39.160
It's really scary when it's deserted, huh...

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.700
Hayami-san.

00:06:52.820 --> 00:06:54.030
What?

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:58.040
Great timing. You are really good at French, aren't you?

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.980
The French test I got back today was a disaster.

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.260
You want me to help out on your homework?

00:07:02.260 --> 00:07:03.560
Bingo!

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:09.000
I'm really busy, why not ask the Sweets Princes for help?

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:10.400
I see...

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:16.370
Could it be I'm a nuisance so she hates me?

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:20.700
I see...

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:25.370
After Hayami-san became a second-year student, she seems to have changed.

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:26.310
Is that so?

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:28.800
Yeah, she was a lot more cheerful.

00:07:29.350 --> 00:07:32.590
She was also in C-group when making sweets and did her best.

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.160
C-group!?

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:36.040
C, D, E.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:37.970
That means she fell 3 levels!?

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:40.320
I don't know the exact details...

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:44.980
...but she seems to have failed her mid-term exams.

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.590
Is that so?

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:49.030
C-group...

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:52.280
I'll have you join the A-group.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.910
You're kidding. Why am I-?

00:07:54.910 --> 00:08:00.390
She's better than me who coincidentally entered A-group.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.210
You've been working hard, haven't you?

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.250
I-Is that so?

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:10.090
Anyway, if the person himself doesn't have the motivation, there is no way to help him.

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:13.250
Putting that aside, let's do our French homework.

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:15.840
Yeah...

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:28.700
Hey, who are you looking for?

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:38.200
There she is.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:42.000
Preparation?

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:45.640
Next week is going to be chiffon cake test, isn't it?

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:47.980
So, want to practice making it after school?

00:08:47.980 --> 00:08:49.700
Why me?

00:08:49.700 --> 00:08:55.680
Umm... well.... compared to making it alone, I think it'd be more fun to make it with someone else.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:59.390
If making it alone is boring, why not ask the Sweets Princes?

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:05.870
Compared to me who is in F-group, wouldn't friends in A-group be better?

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.840
No matter what downsides, they can help to patch it up.

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:11.080
That's the problem.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.610
It won't help if I don't clear it by myself.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:19.450
Besides, I think you are better than me who is in F-group.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:20.520
How can that be?

00:09:20.520 --> 00:09:22.170
I'm hopeless at it.

00:09:22.170 --> 00:09:25.570
Even now I don't know how I entered A-group.

00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:28.990
Compared to me, in the first year you were a lot more-

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:32.490
I don't care about what happened in first year!

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:35.070
Hayami-san...

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:37.720
It feels like she's really angry.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:47.560
Ichigo, let's return to the room.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.060
You are going to catch a cold.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:01.090
I had enough.

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:02.700
I have already submitted the form to quit school.

00:10:03.600 --> 00:10:05.190
Form to quit school?

00:10:05.800 --> 00:10:10.800
Even though I said I'd enroll to St. Marie because I like sweets.

00:10:10.800 --> 00:10:12.880
But it seems I don't have that talent.

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:17.550
Don't worry, Mother.

00:10:17.550 --> 00:10:18.480
I'm alright.

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:22.290
In preparation for the transfer school entrance examination,

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:27.360
right now I'm putting in effort on other subjects other than the sweets examination.

00:10:27.360 --> 00:10:30.940
Hayami-san, is she going to quit St. Marie?

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:45.620
Hayami-san, is she really going to transfer schools?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:48.120
The time when I just transferred in...

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:53.290
I also thought about quitting St. Marie.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:57.460
I even ran away from school to go back home.

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.670
However...

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:03.030
Kashino, and also Andou-kun and Hanabusa-kun.

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:07.600
And there's also Rumi-san and the others who stayed by my side and encouraged me,

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:09.170
that's why I overcame it.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:12.270
But for Hayami-san...

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:17.280
Lately, Hayami is really quiet.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.690
Yeah, right.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.460
She was noisy in the past.

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:22.780
She said: "Let's practice making sweets after school".

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:24.960
She said "practice".

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:28.810
She also said "to do our best to rise up to better groups".

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:30.890
Hayami-san did?

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:35.940
I enrolled in St. Marie because I wanted to open a cake counter in my family's shop.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:37.960
I don't know if I should continue or give up.

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:43.100
My family also owns a Japanese confectionery shop, but the food is actually factory made in large quantities.

00:11:43.100 --> 00:11:45.350
Making sweets doesn't have any relation to it.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:48.540
Mine's also have professionals making them.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:51.850
I wonder in the case I manage to graduate, I just need to show a bit of proper knowledge on making them.

00:11:51.850 --> 00:11:53.280
That's right.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:57.980
Ah, properly, properly.

00:11:56.460 --> 00:11:57.980
I see.

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:01.790
Hayami-san was working really hard.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:04.620
But with the other 3 guys...

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:09.300
Is there anything that I can help out on?

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:15.090
But if I do something, the Sweets Princes will say this and that again...

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.380
Owww....

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:23.370
Why are you alone acting cool?

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.420
I wasn't acting cool!

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:28.490
I am deep in thought now.

00:12:28.490 --> 00:12:31.470
What can I do in this situation when the Sweets Princes aren't here-

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:36.350
What's with you!? Don't keep staring at me!

00:12:37.360 --> 00:12:39.440
Sweets Princes could be of help after all.

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:45.200
Sweets Prince-sama, I have a request.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:47.190
W-What do you want?

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:55.380
Hayami-san.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:57.880
Sweets Princes.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.260
I apologise for intruding when you are studying.

00:13:00.260 --> 00:13:01.710
Can you come along with us?

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:04.730
U-Umm...

00:13:04.730 --> 00:13:07.390
Eh, w-wait...

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:10.600
Why are you three...

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:13.500
This place is...

00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:15.600
Hayami Erika-san.

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:18.290
Welcome to the pâtissière's showdown.

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:19.810
Amano-san.

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:23.480
What exactly is happening!?

00:13:23.480 --> 00:13:24.640
Didn't I say it?

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:27.130
It's the pâtissière's showdown.

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:32.000
If you win, you can quit St. Marie and transfer schools.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:34.550
But if I win, you cannot transfer schools.

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:36.020
What the hell is that!?

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:39.720
If I'll transfer or not is none of your business!

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:43.620
Amano-san will be very inconvenienced if Hayami-san isn't here.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:47.890
She's a clumsy, stupid and somehow god knows how she entered A-group.

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.850
If she gives up, she'd jump right into F-group.

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:51.900
Huh?

00:13:54.020 --> 00:13:56.400
Anyway, just go along with us.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.230
I beg you.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:14:00.430
Yes.

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:05.150
Then, let's start the the pâtissière's showdown!

00:14:12.610 --> 00:14:14.830
This time's theme is Chiffon cake.

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:20.160
The basis is Chiffon but for the icing, you can do your own type of arrangement.

00:14:20.160 --> 00:14:23.240
Please take the ingredients you need from this table.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.970
Well then, start.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.850
Why do I have to do such a thing...

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:45.070
What kind of Chiffon cake should I make?

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.160
Hayami-san put in granulated sugar, right?

00:14:48.160 --> 00:14:49.730
Amano used refined white sugar.

00:14:49.730 --> 00:14:51.900
It's getting interesting rather quickly.

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:54.360
Ichigo, do your best.

00:14:56.680 --> 00:14:59.040
That girl is using lemon?

00:14:59.040 --> 00:14:59.910
And Ichigo is?

00:15:00.700 --> 00:15:02.590
She poured in milk tea?

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:06.340
Hot.

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:08.720
You have to cool it before tasting.

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:11.520
Geez, think more about your order of doing things.

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:14.390
Looking at that part, Hayami-san is more proficient.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.570
Ah, I'm out of time.

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:27.100
Can Ichigo even win like that?

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:28.990
She will win. She has to win.

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:35.950
It won't work. It's bad if the merengue doesn't bubble out slightly hard.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.290
But it seems she managed to do it.

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.690
Don't beat it too roughly and break the merengue.

00:15:56.390 --> 00:15:58.920
Well, next will be the icing.

00:15:58.920 --> 00:16:01.220
The part where Ichigo-chan is the worst.

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.790
She seems to be using honey icing.

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:11.490
What would Ichigo use?

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:17.450
Using plain old icing is really boring.

00:16:20.230 --> 00:16:21.080
Ichigo!

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:22.780
Amano-san!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.470
Thanks for just now.

00:16:33.470 --> 00:16:34.750
What for?

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:38.260
The icing. It was almost going to be lumpy.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:41.870
I'm really stupid. I shouldn't have bothered with it. But..

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:45.400
Hayami-san really love to make sweets, right?

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:46.870
Because you love it.

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:50.320
That's why you can't just stand on the side watching the sweets become horrible, right?

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:53.240
That might be true.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:57.620
Since I was little, I really liked to make sweets.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.040
Ai-chan, you can't touch it yet!

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.060
Ki-chan, if you don't flip it over, it will get burnt.

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.420
See, it really looks like a cake!

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:11.990
I made a real cake!

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:17.150
The time when I used the cakemix to make my first pound cake,

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:19.020
I was really touched.

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:20.970
But now if I think about it, it looks like child's play.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:24.180
But to just have that feeling of liking is really amazing.

00:17:24.180 --> 00:17:26.450
With that, you continued to work hard.

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:31.260
After enrolling in St. Marie, I was really happy when I entered C-group.

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:35.240
I thought if I put in more effort, I'd be able to get further.

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:40.030
But, on the day of the examinations...

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:44.360
I caught a cold and had a fever.

00:17:44.360 --> 00:17:47.300
Even so, I felt that I should participate in the examinations.

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:49.750
And then...

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.040
My score went downhill.

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:04.550
When I became a second-year student, I fell to F-group.

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:07.780
Nevertheless I wanted to continue to work hard.

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:08.650
I know.

00:18:09.320 --> 00:18:14.790
Matsumoto-kun, Sakata-kun and Nakamura-kun from F-group are all half-hearted.

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:17.190
With that, even I wouldn't have the motivation.

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:24.370
I really envy Amano-san.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:29.710
You just transferred and entered into the Sweets Prince's A-group.

00:18:30.280 --> 00:18:34.210
Even though you are a beginner, your skills are getting better and better.

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.910
I thought it was because you were together with the Sweets Princes,

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:39.800
that's why you could draw out your full potential.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:42.420
That might be true...

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:43.870
But I was wrong.

00:18:44.360 --> 00:18:46.810
Because Amano-san put in all of her effort.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.330
Because she never gave up.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:52.940
And above all, there are friends who support you,

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.210
that's why you can make such good sweets.

00:18:56.460 --> 00:18:58.420
Hayami-san.

00:18:58.420 --> 00:19:00.310
Aren't we friends too?

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.540
Amano-san...

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:26.880
It's done!

00:19:27.730 --> 00:19:29.790
Magical macaron.

00:19:29.790 --> 00:19:31.560
Sweets Romance Card.

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:34.820
Come out!

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:47.030
Amano-san's Milk Tea Chiffon cake.

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:51.360
I think because she used refined white sugar, the milk tea's gentleness is still there.

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:54.250
Compared to orange peel, I prefer the milk tea's sweetness.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:04.050
On the other hand, Hayami-san used granulated sugar, the lemon Chiffon is baked to its fullest taste, right?

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:07.970
The icing is honey, the taste and the appearance is great.

00:20:07.970 --> 00:20:09.630
But she didn't have to use mint.

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:14.330
So who's the winner?

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:15.650
Is it me or Hayami-san?

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:17.150
Well...

00:20:17.150 --> 00:20:18.570
In this case...

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.650
Actually...

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.010
This battle...

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:30.980
...is a draw!

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:32.950
How can that be? This is troublesome.

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:36.580
That's right. If we don't determine the winner, what will Hayami-san do?

00:20:36.580 --> 00:20:39.460
That should be decided by Hayami herself.

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:45.470
You're right...

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:46.860
Hayami-san.

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.250
Gonna continue today?

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:50.030
Yeah.

00:20:50.030 --> 00:20:52.480
Matsumoto-kun, can I ask you to make merengue?

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.400
O-Okay.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:57.960
Sakata-kun, this weak flour, can you put in the ingredients?

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:59.020
Y-Yeah...

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:03.550
Nakamura-kun will wash the utensils with me together.

00:21:03.550 --> 00:21:05.240
S-Sure.

